cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. This is the
  software artifact for the paper "AutoFLC: An LLM-Based Flowchart
  Generation Tool for Legacy Code Repository" (under review).
type: software
title: "AutoFLC"
abstract: >-
  A Docker-based tool that automatically converts C source code
  into PlantUML flowcharts using an LLM backend, with input via
  ZIP upload or a GitHub repository/branch link.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dfjdkjkdf/AutoFLC"
